## 2. Nodes (in execution order)

A linear chain: node 1 -> 2 -> ... -> terminal. One block per node, in order.
Each node is a normal spp task under `sub-tasks/<node-id>/`; its OUTPUT_SCHEMA,
metric, and floor are in that node's own `plan.md`.

